{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25389","headline":"招隐山观玉蘂树戏书即事奉寄江西沈大夫阁老 · 李德裕","name":"招隐山观玉蘂树戏书即事奉寄江西沈大夫阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉蘂天中树，金闺昔共窥。\n落英闲舞雪，密叶乍低帷旧赏烟霄远，前欢岁月移。\n今来想颜色，还似忆琼枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}